  "ruleText": "He-P 4043.02 Scope. The requirements of this Part are in addition to, and not in substitution for, requirements in other Parts of these rules.\n\nSource. #6827, eff 8-6-98; ss by #8692, INTERIM, eff 7-27-06, EXPIRES: 2-2-07; ss by #8808, eff 1-24-07; ss by #10804, eff 3-26-15; ss by #14336, eff 8-8-25; EXPIRES: 8-8-35",
